; rented-turn-meter-run.fk — the body reads the rented mind's own spend:
; sums every output_tokens in the session transcript. Receipts record the
; figure; consecutive readings give the per-prompt delta. Measure,
; observe, optimize — pointed at the mind that is costing.
; stdin line 1: transcript path.
; preludes: form-stdlib/form-cli-movement.bml
(do
    (let path (read_line))
    (let total (rtm-session-total path))
    (print (str_concat "session-output-tokens=" (int_to_str total)))
    0)
